            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Lela"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Thanks for the recipe. An easy recipe to use on fruits and veggies. Instead of plain water, I think the vinegar helps to clean the produce.",
            "datePublished": "2025-12-06T04:51:30.586Z"
          },
          {
